WHY GPL AND NOT SOMETHING PERMISSIVE
------------------------------------

UOOM links against the DOOM source release via doomgeneric, which is GPLv2.
Everything in this repository is therefore a derivative work and inherits that
licence, including the port layers under Software/Libs, the host harness under
host/, and the tooling under tools/.

The full licence text ships with the vendored engine at
third_party/doomgeneric/LICENSE after running tools/fetch-doomgeneric.sh, and
is also at <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html>.
